with funding that gassing and they were glad to&nbsp;
see him go. That's what they've been told. that&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:35:36.240 --> 01:35:42.800
that was not the case. And so we ended up getting&nbsp;
me into the airport that we had to go through the&nbsp;&nbsp;

