our equipment, our gear. Uh my uncle had his&nbsp;
cocaine hidden in there. One of the first things&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:36:58.000 --> 01:37:03.600
he did, the Japanese folks, they loaded up our&nbsp;
truck for us and I was made to pretty much sit&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:37:03.600 --> 01:37:08.800
in the truck. I like to get out and talk to&nbsp;
