01:45:11.040 --> 01:45:15.920
they'd been telling me to relax. Relax. Relax&nbsp;
when you land because I was so tense. They said,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:45:15.920 --> 01:45:23.600
"You need to relax." And so I was too relaxed and&nbsp;
I strained it in Boyisey during training. And then&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:45:23.600 --> 01:45:33.120
on this exercise, I was still relaxed too much and&nbsp;
wham and it hurt my back. And so we got me off of&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:45:33.120 --> 01:45:39.840
the line and it had strained it, but I was okay.&nbsp;
I was like, "No, I'm okay. We can still go through&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:45:39.840 --> 01:45:46.480
with with operation. You know, I'm not that bad&nbsp;
off." And so we moved across the rooftop to where&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:45:46.480 --> 01:45:52.800
we had a shootute nest and that's where they put&nbsp;
me in the piece of equipment up there on top of&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:45:52.800 --> 01:46:00.320
the roof. And so they had a big piece of HVAC&nbsp;
