01:46:00.320 --> 01:46:08.800
and inside the this piece of mechanical equipment&nbsp;
was a rifle setup and a little area where I could&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:46:08.800 --> 01:46:15.120
lay down with that rifle. And so I was placed in&nbsp;
this piece of mechanical equipment and there was&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:46:15.120 --> 01:46:20.640
stuff moving around me. You know, it wasn't very&nbsp;
comforting being in there. And I was stuck in&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:46:20.640 --> 01:46:26.720
there for I don't know how long hours I was stuck&nbsp;
in this. And it was all night. I don't know what&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:46:26.720 --> 01:46:32.240
time of night it was that I got there, but they&nbsp;
put me in this thing. And they sealed it back up,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:46:32.240 --> 01:46:40.160
put the screws back in, and then they left.&nbsp;
They went to their places and that's where I was&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:46:40.160 --> 01:46:48.080
stationed. And I was in contact with them through&nbsp;
my comms. I had a little um I had a vial with me,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:46:48.080 --> 01:46:58.080
a vial to wake up. And my uncle gave me gave&nbsp;
me some blue blue potion of sleep before they&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:46:58.080 --> 01:47:05.840
closed me up so that I would fall asleep. And&nbsp;
so I fell asleep when they closed it up. And&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:47:05.840 --> 01:47:13.440
then when I woke up, the comms were going off.&nbsp;
Something was going on. And I woke up and my&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:47:13.440 --> 01:47:20.960
uncle talked to me and he told me to take the drug&nbsp;
I had, the red drug. And I drank the the drug,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:47:20.960 --> 01:47:26.720
the potion they had given to me to wake up and&nbsp;
get operational. And I can remember just being&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:47:26.720 --> 01:47:34.240
crammed in this thing. It was hot. It was loud.&nbsp;
It was stuffy. It was awful. But that, you know,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:47:34.240 --> 01:47:40.800
deal you're programmed to deal with that. And so I&nbsp;
was in there and we tested our calms, went through&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:47:40.800 --> 01:47:46.080
all that and then it started to get closer.&nbsp;
Now during all of this, my uncle would say,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:47:46.080 --> 01:47:51.760
"I'll be back. I've got to talk to somebody else."&nbsp;
Because he was also in contact with our Japanese&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:47:51.760 --> 01:47:59.200
counterparts. There were other people in Japan&nbsp;
working with us. It wasn't just CIA. And so in&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:47:59.200 --> 01:48:07.040
all of this, the way the CIA was going to get to&nbsp;
Kumi, Emma, is uh there was a rival gang of the of&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:48:07.040 --> 01:48:16.000
the Yamaguchi Gumi known as the Nano Nakano Kai.&nbsp;
I'm sure I'm butchering the pronunciation, but the&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:48:16.000 --> 01:48:23.120
Nakano Kai. And they were, I believe, an offshoot&nbsp;
of the Yamaguchi. And they were a violent,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:48:23.120 --> 01:48:30.880
more violent group. and they wanted Tkumi dead for&nbsp;
some reason and they had come to the CIA and they&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:48:30.880 --> 01:48:38.160
had asked the CIA for help in killing Takumi. The&nbsp;
CIA who had been trying to find a good way to kill&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:48:38.160 --> 01:48:46.960
Tkumi said great, what an awesome opportunity.&nbsp;
They seized on it because now they had a cover.&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:48:46.960 --> 01:48:53.600
So you had these four guys of the Nakano Kai&nbsp;
that were going to come in to the Oriental Hotel,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:48:53.600 --> 01:48:58.880
which is where Tacumi was was going to be that day&nbsp;
at that time that we were going to get rid of him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:48:58.880 --> 01:49:05.840
These four guys come in and they were going&nbsp;
to shoot up the place and I was supposed to&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:49:05.840 --> 01:49:15.520
hit Toui through the window uh in the hip as a&nbsp;
sniper to ensure that he was dead because the&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:49:15.520 --> 01:49:23.680
manokai was absolutely terrified of Takumi.&nbsp;
if he would have lived through this assault,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:49:23.680 --> 01:49:30.320
those four guys and their leaders, it would&nbsp;
have been held to pay. And so they they wanted&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:49:30.320 --> 01:49:35.920
to guarantee he was dead. That's why they come&nbsp;
to the CIA. Can you guarantee he'll die if we do&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:49:35.920 --> 01:49:42.800
this? And so they came in from the ground. So I&nbsp;
get woke up and it's gonna happen. It's going to&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:49:42.800 --> 01:49:50.800
happen. They're coming in. They're coming in. And&nbsp;
then all hell broke loose out of my scope. Just&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:49:50.800 --> 01:49:58.480
seemed like all hell broke loose. I was squared&nbsp;
up on an individual. My optic was uh connected to&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:49:58.480 --> 01:50:06.400
a video recorder of some kind that was connected&nbsp;
to a screen in my uncle's van which was down in an&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:50:06.400 --> 01:50:14.480
alley there in Kobe. And so he could see through&nbsp;
my scope from his from his van, which would we&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:50:14.480 --> 01:50:20.480
would call his command center at that point, see&nbsp;
what I was aiming at. And he directed my aim,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:50:20.480 --> 01:50:26.560
told me who to hit at the moment he wanted me&nbsp;
to hit it. And then I was made to fire. Now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:50:26.560 --> 01:50:35.680
when I fired, I blacked out. I instantly blacked&nbsp;
out. Boom. Blackout. Gone. When I went hunting,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:50:35.680 --> 01:50:43.600
when uh I was studying at the University of Idaho&nbsp;
later in life, I went out hunting for deer and I&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:50:43.600 --> 01:50:53.200
was up on a hill and I squared up on a deer and&nbsp;
I almost passed out. I was like, "Oh my god,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:50:53.200 --> 01:50:57.920
don't pass out. Don't pass out. Don't pass out."&nbsp;
And I could never understand what was wrong with&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:50:57.920 --> 01:51:05.200
me. Why would I pass out just from squaring up on&nbsp;
a deer? And that's why because I was programmed&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:51:05.200 --> 01:51:13.200
to pass out after I fired the shot. They wanted me&nbsp;
out. They wanted me immobile because I don't know&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:51:13.200 --> 01:51:20.720
what the percentages are, but your movement from&nbsp;
your shoot nest is what'll give you away after&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:51:20.720 --> 01:51:27.040
the shot is fired. They did not want me moving.&nbsp;
They did not want me mobile. Nothing. They just&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:51:27.040 --> 01:51:35.760
wanted me almost like I was dead. I just went out.&nbsp;
I blacked out. The next thing I remember is being&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:51:35.760 --> 01:51:43.920
woken up. Now, I want to add I don't know who&nbsp;
I shot. I don't know if I hit the Kumi. I don't&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:51:43.920 --> 01:51:54.000
know if I hit another individual. Believe he was&nbsp;
a dentist. Uh his name I believe Hiroshi Huray.&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:51:54.000 --> 01:52:02.240
And that individual was killed in the exchange in&nbsp;
the Oriental Hotel. Because when I would talk to&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:52:02.240 --> 01:52:09.440
my uncle later in a different memory about this,&nbsp;
my uncle would tell me, "I didn't kill Tumi. I&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:52:09.440 --> 01:52:17.440
killed an innocent bystander, a dentist who was&nbsp;
there at the scene. This is what my uncle would&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:52:17.440 --> 01:52:24.240
tell me. But I was supposed to kill that man if&nbsp;
I killed." That's who they would have wanted me&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:52:24.240 --> 01:52:32.160
to kill. It's a mess. The whole thing is a mess.&nbsp;
They're constantly messing with your head. So, I&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:52:32.160 --> 01:52:40.880
was woke up. They got me out of that thing, out of&nbsp;
that piece of HVAC equipment. It was daylight. It&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:52:40.880 --> 01:52:46.800
was broad daylight. I said, "What the hell's going&nbsp;
on? It is broad daylight. We are not supposed to&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:52:46.800 --> 01:52:52.000
move like this." And they said, "No, we got to&nbsp;
move. We got to move now. there's no time to&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:52:52.000 --> 01:52:58.160
wait. The police had already been to the rooftop.&nbsp;
They already knew something was up and they were&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:52:58.160 --> 01:53:05.920
going to come back with dogs. And so we had to get&nbsp;
off of the roof fast. This roof had flat spots on&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:53:05.920 --> 01:53:12.960
